{"id":"medium-001","difficulty":"medium","title":"两数之和","description":"返回两数下标之和为 target。期望 O(n)。","function_signature":"def two_sum(nums: list, target: int)","entry_point":"two_sum","language":"python","constraints":"2 <= n <= 10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(n)"},"required_edge_cases":["无解","重复"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[2,7,11,15],9],"expected":[0,1]},{"args":[[3,2,4],6],"expected":[1,2]},{"args":[[3,3],6],"expected":[0,1]}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[0,0,0],1],"expected":-1},{"args":[[-1,-2,-3,-4],-7],"expected":[2,3]}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"双重循环","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n^2)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"无解返回 -1","代码实现":"```python\ndef two_sum(nums, target):\n    n=len(nums)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i+1,n):\n            if nums[i]+nums[j]==target: return [i,j]\n    return -1\n```","自测说明":"公开用例通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":false,"process_valid":false,"first_error_step":"step_2_complexity","error_types":["算法选择错误","复杂度分析错误"],"note":"暴力 O(n^2) 不满足 O(n)"}}